    "name": "Pitchcrew · Diagnostics Coverage",
    "description": "App renderer error tracking is manually instrumented with sanitized fixed categories; collection begins after shipping. Other diagnostics must be described according to their own instrumentation. Empty charts never imply healthy behavior."
